{
  "id": "conformance-error-route-only",
  "name": "Conformance: Error route only",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "RFC 0257. start succeeds, and the only terminal on-fail is reached over an any_failed edge, so it is skipped with no condition anywhere. The run MUST end run.completed with skippedTerminals [\"on-fail\"]. Conformance scenario: v2-all-terminals-skipped.test.ts.",
